# npm org set alice bob developer

### write
PUT https://registry.npmjs.org/-/org/alice/user
user-agent: npm/11.9.0 node/v24.14.0 win32 x64 workspaces/false
npm-auth-type: web
npm-command: org
authorization: Bearer melete-proxy-adds-this
content-type: application/json
accept: */*

{"user":"bob","role":"developer"}
